# Everything here is excluded from the build context — the snapshot of files
# sent to the Docker daemon before a build starts.
#
# It matters for speed (node_modules is ~200 MB and would be copied only to be
# overwritten by `npm ci`) and for safety: .env holds real credentials and must
# never end up in an image layer, where it would persist even if a later
# instruction deleted it.

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/.env.local

.git
.gitignore
.github

docs
"For my understanding"
*.md
!api/migrations/*.md

**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
.vscode
.idea
